senses.gloss:
पूरयितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who fills or fills up;
one who fulfils or satisfies; (ता), m. an epithet of
Viṣṇu; of Śiva.

पूर्तिन्, ई, इनी, इ, Ved. possessing the merit of
pious liberality [cf. पूर्त]; filling, completing;
effective.

पूर्वक, अस्, इका, अम्, earlier, former, previous,
prior, anterior, preceding, antecedent (often like
पूर्व, q. v., at the end of a comp.; cf. स्त्री-प्˚);
first; preceded by, accompanied by, connected with,
attended with (at the end of comps. = पूर्व, q. v.;
cf. व्याहृति-प्˚); (अस्), m. a forefather, ancestor;
(अम्), ind. preceded by, with, according to, in con-
formity with (at the end of comps.; cf. विधि-प्˚,
प्रीति-प्˚).

पूर्विक, अस्, आ, अम्, formerly or previously done;
formerly invited; पूर्वक, previous; [cf. स्त्री-
पूर्विक.]
